### 6b. Refresh Access Token - Failure Case (Invalid / Expired Refresh Token)
# @name refreshTokenFailure
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "invalid_or_expired_refresh_token_here"
}

/*
===================================================================
EXPECTED API RESPONSE (401 Unauthorized):
===================================================================
{
  "statusCode": 401,
  "message": "Invalid or expired refresh token"
}
*/